 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "The bug is fixed. Today I ask the team to review my work. This is the operating system. I see the application. The pull request is new to me. Maria asks me to open a pull request. Maria smiles and says, \"Are you free tonight?\" I answer, \"Would you like to join us?\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "tts": "The bug is fixed. Today I ask the team to review my work. This is the operating system. I see the application. The pull request is new to me. Maria asks me to open a pull request. Maria smiles and says, \"Are you free tonight?\" I answer, \"Would you like to join us?\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "缺陷修好了。今天我请团队评审我的工作。这是操作系统。我看到了应用程序。拉取请求对我来说很新。Maria 让我创建拉取请求。Maria微笑着说：\"你今晚有空吗？\"我回答：\"你愿意加入我们吗？\"Maria 帮了我很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "operating system",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "操作系统，管理硬件并运行应用的基础软件"
    },
    {
     "w": "application",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "应用程序，帮助用户完成具体任务的软件"
    },
    {
     "w": "Are you free tonight?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你今晚有空吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Would you like to join us?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你愿意加入我们吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "pull request",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "拉取请求，请团队检查并合并一组代码变化"
    },
    {
     "w": "open a pull request",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "创建拉取请求，发起代码评审"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Leo invites me to coffee on Friday. I say yes. I hear, \"That sounds great.\" then I answer, \"Maybe another time.\" I try to install software. Maria asks me to uninstall a program. I point to the PR description. I request a review. I feel good today.",
   "tts": "Leo invites me to coffee on Friday. I say yes. I hear, \"That sounds great.\" then I answer, \"Maybe another time.\" I try to install software. Maria asks me to uninstall a program. I point to the P R description. I request a review. I feel good today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "Leo 邀请我周五去喝咖啡。我答应了。我听到：\"听起来很不错。\"然后我回答：\"也许下次吧。\"我试着安装软件。Maria 让我卸载程序。我指着PR 描述。我请求评审。我今天感觉很好。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "install software",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "安装软件，把软件配置到电脑上"
    },
    {
     "w": "uninstall a program",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "卸载程序，从电脑中移除软件"
    },
    {
     "w": "That sounds great.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "听起来很不错。"
    },
    {
     "w": "Maybe another time.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "也许下次吧。"
    },
    {
     "w": "PR description",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "PR 描述，说明改动、原因和验证方法"
    },
    {
     "w": "request a review",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "请求评审，邀请他人检查代码"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. These are the draft changes. I see the merge request. The system settings are new to me. Maria asks me to restart the computer. Maria smiles and says, \"What time shall we meet?\" I answer, \"I'll let you know.\" My first pull request is open. This week, I learned a lot.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. These are the draft changes. I see the merge request. The system settings are new to me. Maria asks me to restart the computer. Maria smiles and says, \"What time shall we meet?\" I answer, \"I'll let you know.\" My first pull request is open. This week, I learned a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。这些是草稿改动。我看到了合并请求。系统设置对我来说很新。Maria 让我重新启动电脑。Maria微笑着说：\"我们几点见面？\"我回答：\"我会告诉你的。\"我的第一个拉取请求打开了。这一周，我学到了很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "system settings",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "系统设置，调整操作系统行为的选项"
    },
    {
